  "defect_observations": [
    "Unit is a readonly unit of this packet (owner w02c-p15-014); assessed on the routed files parts/p15/uniform-integrability-and-conditional-limits.tex (\\input at handbook/parts/p15.tex:27) and annex/p15/uniform-integrability-and-conditional-limits.tex (\\input at handbook/annex/p15.tex:26).",
    "annex 507-509 (extinction-or-escape): the step from P(Z_{n+1}=0 | natural filtration)=p_0^{Z_n} to P(D | F_n) >= p_0^K on the shifted index uses monotonicity of conditional probability (D contains {Z_{n+1}=0}) only implicitly ('the chance of eventual zero is at least'); not a coverage gap, flagged for review.",
    "annex 566-567 (backward-martingale-convergence) relies on the claim that the greedy construction in thm:p15-upcrossing-inequality realizes the maximal crossing count; the cited theorem (handbook/parts/p15/martingales-and-convergence.tex 184-196) does state U_n as that maximum, so the reference resolves.",
